message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Reference-aware cross-cell SOH evaluation: analysis code and derived data"
version: "1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Cai
    given-names: Ming-Jia
    affiliation: "National Kaohsiung University of Science and Technology"
  - family-names: Dai
    given-names: Hong-Jie
