license:
  - MIT
  - ODbL-1.0
abstract: >-
  Companion code and per-row derived data for the manuscript "Do Partial
  Incremental Capacity Features Beat Holding the Last Measured Reference
  Capacity? A Reference-Aware Cross-Cell Evaluation of State-of-Health
  Estimation for 18650 Lithium-Ion Cells". Re-runs P-B/P-B+, the ZOH, LIN2
  and LINALL baselines and the cluster bootstrap from the derived tables of
  34 cells.
keywords:
  - state of health
  - lithium-ion battery
  - incremental capacity analysis
  - Gaussian process
  - evaluation protocol
